{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51981","headline":"歌（故人朱当敏归时，臯及宾客皆送之。至洞门，客以尺八击玉磬，臯和而歌云云。歌毕，忽然俱去。） · 虞臯","name":"歌（故人朱当敏归时，臯及宾客皆送之。至洞门，客以尺八击玉磬，臯和而歌云云。歌毕，忽然俱去。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝爲雄兮暮爲雌，天地终尽兮人生几时。\n（《全五代诗》八七引《榕阴新简》）（〖1〗《全闽诗话》卷八、《十国春秋》卷九九引《榕阴新检》，云虞臯入罗喜洞後作此歌，及出洞已爲明洪武十二年，则此诗显出明人附会。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}